flowchart TB
    Browser[Authenticated Streamlit session] --> Services[Application services]
    Services --> Ingest[PDF validation and page extraction]
    Ingest --> Chunk[Recursive text splitting]
    Chunk --> Embeddings[EmbeddingService]
    Embeddings --> FAISS[(FAISS and JSON snapshots)]
    Services --> Query[Question validation and bounded memory]
    Query --> Retrieve[Cosine retrieval and filters]
    FAISS --> Retrieve
    Retrieve --> Guard[Untrusted evidence and prompt guardrails]
    Guard --> Gemini[Gemini structured claims]
    Gemini --> Verify[Quote and source validation]
    Verify --> Browser
    Services --> SQL[(MySQL metadata and audit)]
